  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring adorable little princess baby characters wearing elegant dresses, gold crowns, and royal accessories.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom mugs, tumblers, coasters, princess-themed blanks, and baby drinkware.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for home decor, infant apparel, and baby shower gifts.   Custom apparel creation for baby onesies, princess t-shirts, hoodies, festive aprons, and seasonal tote bags.   Baby shower decor, nursery wall art, greeting cards, birthday invitations, and custom sticker designs.",
